  m_text: "Cick and drag on the requested items to serve both rich and poor customers
    alike. \n\nHowever, beware of your finances. Make up the money you need to pay
    off your rent in 3 days.  Or you may have to sell your own face. \n\nMake too
    many mistakes, and you may be the next victim on the operating table. \n\nGood
    Luck!\n\n\n---The Rising Hope Party---"
